          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te neitu eye orrindik te nkolong nabo arashu too nkolong'i are, nemeitamei amu ore orrindik naa impisai enyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
