              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa te neyioloi aajo etamoo oshi ilo kiteng earisho neitu eing'or olopeny, nelak ninye olkiteng to lkiteng neaku ina ng'ues natua enenye.",
          "type": "text",
